because those respawn times on certain maps get just ridiculous, and one bad death can take you out of the fight for what feels like forever.

11
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:18,060
And Scout can create way more for his team than the scoreboard actually shows.

12
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:23,480
You can make half the enemy team turn around, pull someone away from the objective, or force their medic backwards,

13
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:27,300
