68
00:06:45,119 --> 00:06:47,839
It's also a really common place for Blue to put a teleporter,

69
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:50,399
so it's naturally somewhere Scout can find a lot of value.

70
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:52,559
Target priority is also important.

71
00:06:52,559 --> 00:06:55,519
In general, if you see something like a direct hit soldier,

72
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:59,039
there's a good chance he's using it because he wants to destroy your team's sentry nest.

73
00:06:59,039 --> 00:07:04,639
Scout can choose these fights, so you should use that freedom to focus the people who are most threatening to your team.

74
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:08,639
He needs to play as a team better than Blue does on old maps like Gold Rush and Dust Bowl.

