Now I know not everyone wants to treat casual like a scrim and constantly give out cold outs, but this Sixers clip is the clearest way I can show you how powerful they are, and how powerful Scalper comes when his team can actually capitalise on the openings he creates. I don't create this opening by dropping the medic, I create it by forcing basically their entire team to turn around and focus on me. For those few seconds none of them are looking at my team, which gives everyone else the opportunity to move forward and wipe out basically their entire team.

